[en.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_1]
Slave Trade in Manehattan

[en.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_1_desc]
【The following content is reproduced from “Red Radio”】
Manehattan, the city that prides itself on its bustling streets and vibrant diversity, has unwittingly become the breeding ground for Gladmane’s dark Empire.
Ponies who were once free-spirited and hopeful have found themselves trapped in a nightmarish cycle of servitude. Their dreams crushed, their spirits broken, they are now mere pawns in Gladmane’s twisted game. It’s a cruel twist of fate, turning a city known for its bright lights into a stage for tragedy and heartache.
The tales of those who managed to escape this wretched fate are as chilling as a winter breeze. They speak of lives stripped of dignity, toiling away under the watchful eyes of their captors. It’s a stark reminder that even in a land of friendship and harmony, there are those who would exploit the weak for their own gain.
As word spreads of Gladmane’s heinous deeds, the citizens of Equestria are demanding justice! Gladmane must pay for his crimes! And those who will be held accountable, who will be overthrown, who will be crushed along with Gladmane, is no else than the umbrella — the bogus regime claiming to be “Equestria Empire”!

[en.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_1_o0]
Well, the Empire has to make some statement.

[en.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_1_o1]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_2]
Our Town Address

[en.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_2_desc]
【The following content is reproduced from “Red Radio”】
“Thousands of years ago, our ancestors brought forth on this continent a new nation, conceived in unity and dedicated to the proposition that all ponies are created equal...”
Starlight Glimmer gave a speech in Our Town, addressing the shocking report that had been released earlier. The report, based on first-hoof accounts of ponies who had seen and experienced the crime, painted a dark picture of the city of Manehattan and its surrounding boroughs under the rule of Gladmane. Behind the bright and prosperous city, sweatshops were built in the slums, and poor ponies were enslaved by debt...
Starlight’s speech caused a huge sensation in Equestria. Although everypony knew that there were many shady things going on in the Manehattan Mafia, the report still exceeded everypony’s expectations.

[en.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_2_o0]
Liberate Manehattan!

[en.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_2_o1]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_2_THREAT]
Manehattan Liberation War

[zh.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_1]
马哈顿的奴隶贸易

[zh.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_1_desc]
【以下内容转载自《红色电台》】
马哈顿，这座以繁华街道和多元文化而自豪的城市，不知不觉地成为了乐善黑暗帝国的温床。
曾经自由奔放、充满希望的小马们，现在却发现自己陷入了一个噩梦般的奴役圈子。他们的梦想被粉碎，他们的精神被打破，他们现在只是乐善扭曲游戏中的棋子。这是一个残酷的命运转折，将一个以明亮灯光而闻名的城市变成了悲剧和心碎的舞台。
那些设法逃脱这种可怕命运的故事就像冬天的寒风一样令人不寒而栗。他们谈论的是被剥夺了尊严的生活，在监视着他们的监视下苦苦挣扎。这是一个醒目的提醒，即使在一个友谊和谐的土地上，也有那些为了自己的利益而剥削弱者的小马。
随着乐善的恶行传开，小马利亚的公民们要求正义！乐善必须为他的罪行付出代价！将一起被问责、被推翻、被粉碎的，还有乐善背后的保护伞——小马利亚伪帝国！

[zh.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_1_o0]
不得不做出表态了。

[zh.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_1_o1]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_2]
《平等镇演说》

[zh.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_2_desc]
【以下内容转载自《红色电台》】
“数千年前，我们的先辈们在这个大陆上建立了一个全新的国家，它受孕于团结的理念，并献身于小马们生而平等的理想...”
星光熠熠在平等镇发表了演说，再次强调了此前一份震撼小马利亚的调查报告。报告中以调查小马的亲眼所见和亲身经历为基础，描绘了乐善领导下马哈顿及其周边市区黑暗的一面——城市光鲜亮丽的富饶市区背后，一座座血汗工厂在城市的贫民窟中建立起来，一只只贫穷的小马因无法偿还本不属于他们的债务而沦为奴隶...
星光的演说在小马利亚产生了巨大的轰动，虽然每一只小马都或多或少清楚——马哈顿黑帮的经营中存在着许多见不得光的事情，但这份报告依然超出了所有小马的预期。

[zh.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_2_o0]
解放马哈顿！

[zh.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_2_o1]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C08_RED_RADIO_2_THREAT]
马哈顿解放战争
